---
// NowView -- v1.2 hosts the Expressway watch surface.
//
// In v1.1.0 this component WAS the near-real-time surface. v1.2 (D1-A + D2-B)
// restructures it into the tiered "Expressway watch" observation log, which
// lives in CorridorWatch.astro. NowView now renders that component so the
// /map page wiring (the data-now-active lazy-activation contract and the
// view switcher) is unchanged.
//
// The locked contract is carried INSIDE CorridorWatch.astro verbatim:
//   - the v1.1.0 scan_status honest-empty path (no_usable_pass /
//     degenerate_threshold / low_confidence) -- no new wording for the cron
//     layers' empty state
//   - __fwMap/__fwReady exposed synchronously + the isStyleLoaded()
//     once-guarded poll for this display:none tab
//   - the locked z-order: rainfall context -> roads -> observed flood LAST
//   - #now-root[data-now-active] lazy activation (the parent toggles it)
//
// The stale-revisit copy patches (§5 #4, #5) were applied to that copy where
// it now lives in CorridorWatch.astro (the SAR-revisit callout line and the
// "no expressway flooded" runtime line), so the re-grep returns zero.
import CorridorWatch from "./CorridorWatch.astro";
---

<CorridorWatch />
